### Hold a button (player 0). Buttons: up, down, left, right, a, b, start, select. Players: 0-3
POST http://localhost:5005/api/input
Content-Type: application/json

{ "player": 0, "button": "up", "state": "down" }

### Release it
POST http://localhost:5005/api/input
Content-Type: application/json

{ "player": 0, "button": "up", "state": "up" }

### Tap (down immediately followed by up)
POST http://localhost:5005/api/input
Content-Type: application/json

{ "player": 1, "button": "a", "state": "press" }

### Show the demo app, then use the requests above to see the buttons light up
POST http://localhost:5005/api/apps/input-test

### WebSocket: ws://localhost:5005/ws/input, one message per event, same JSON as above
